    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[This report of the 1938 season was presented at the AGM of the Stoolball Association for Great Britain. It tells of stoolball being played in London, York, Amsterdam, Sri Lanka, India, New Zealand and even on board an ocean liner.]]></Value>
    </description>
